{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>BurnClub 能把公開社交檔案變成由貼文實際使用音樂組成的歌單，適合想從人物口味發掘新歌的讀者。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，只需貼上 Instagram 或 TikTok 公開連結即可開始探索。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-43.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>公開社交檔案變歌單</h2>\n<p>貼上 Instagram 或 TikTok 公開社交檔案連結，BurnClub 便會從貼文找出實際使用的歌曲，整理成可預覽的歌單。你可以逐首試聽，燒錄數碼 CD，或把歌單儲存至 Spotify、Apple Music 及 YouTube Music；無需註冊帳戶，也能查看社群正在發現的音樂，並把成果分享給朋友。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-102-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-103-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-104-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-105-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-106-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-233-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：BurnClub – Song Discovery</li><li>應用類別：Music</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/burnclub-song-discovery/id6816500543?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T00:21:09.762261+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":331,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T00:06:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T14:19:02.042874+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T00:18:26.146749+00:00","content_hash":"8984c7d41ca51e610eb78e9e3870ecbc293d7801158a54b97dac7e67832aa4a1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}